    <description>This flow handles the creation and update of Account Service Role (ASR) records based on Contact-related changes.
1. On Contact creation, it creates an ASR record linking the Contact to the related Account.
2. On update, if &quot;Do Not Contact&quot; is set to true, it updates the ASR with an End Date and End Reason.

The flow ensures ASR records stay in sync with the Contact.
This flow also populates the UFID</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
